  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine Recovery Through Science &amp; Technology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will enable Ukrainian universities to bolster resilience and forge links with UK universities that can protect researchers and university faculties and enable their work to continue during the conflict; harness wider support, for example, towards research that can support Ukraine&#x2019;s recovery; and build lasting connections between UK and Ukraine-based universities, scientists and other innovators and education leaders that can be connected through the mechanism.  To achieve this, the programme will fund activities that encourage, coordinate and enable the UK&#x2019;s university sector to act through the scheme to support immediate and longer-term needs.  The programme matches universities and encourages the adoption of agreements.  The programme provides wider support to raise awareness, build capacity for universities to participate and learn lessons on how to support higher education sectors in crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
